    "description": "Postman collection for testing MifosX Fineract APIs against the local Mifos/Fineract stack.\n\nAPI documentation:  \n[https://sandbox.mifos.community/fineract-provider/swagger-ui/index.html](https://sandbox.mifos.community/fineract-provider/swagger-ui/index.html)\n\nThis collection supports functional, integration, and regression testing of key Fineract endpoints. It uses collection variables for environment-specific configuration, including baseUrl, username, password, tenantId, and tenantKey.",
